  "description": "Fascinated by shipwrecks ever since she was a young girl, Sesir spent her days searching through them in order to find new objects that she could add to her collection. One day, she found some strange artifacts: 2 anchors which allowed her to control the power of waves. This power allowed her to survive in the arid lands, repelling the bandits and pillagers who would attack her village. Interested in her new power, the Warlords of the region proposed that she ally with them. However, Sesir refused. She wanted nothing to do with their methods. She later decided to help Plumatachi: the tyranny of the Warlords had lasted long enough. She took part in what would later be known as the Rebellion of the Angel.",
  "summon": "Have you seen real ships travel on the water before, Summoner?",
  "fusion": "Life is rough in the arid lands. I’ll need this power.",
